  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The African Guarantee Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase loan financing for Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs) in up to 40 African countries, by providing partial guarantees to African banks to enable them to scale up their lending to SMEs.  The project will contribute towards the poverty reduction MDG by promoting the mobilisation of $5.7 billion in new SME financing by 2018, enabling the provision of credit support to 18,800 additional SMEs and the creation of 453,000 new jobs within those SMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
